  "title": "Confluent Kafka Cluster",
  "description": "Curated Kafka observability: cluster health (active controllers, offline/under-replicated/under-min-ISR partitions, unclean leader elections), broker throughput, tail request latency (P50-P999), JVM/CPU/disk resource usage, and error/consumer-lag health for the Kafka broker and KRaft controller in the confluent namespace."
